    <item>
      <title>达梦数据库</title>
      <link>https://jhlzlove.github.io/post/skill/db/dameng/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 27 Oct 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (jhlz)</author>
      <guid>https://jhlzlove.github.io/post/skill/db/dameng/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>达梦数据库</h1><p>作者：jhlz（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h2 id="常规安装">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%b8%b8%e8%a7%84%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85"></a>
常规安装
</h2><p>常规安装可以参照达梦自带的安装手册。为便于复制，这里再重复一次，安装的目录为 <code>/home/dmdba</code></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 创建用户和用户组，并设置密码</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">groupadd -g <span class="m">12349</span> dinstall
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">useradd -u <span class="m">12345</span> -g dinstall -m -d /home/dmdba -s /bin/bash dmdba
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">passwd dmdba
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 命令行安装，按照提示进行选择即可</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./DMInstall.bin -i
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 切换用户初始化数据库</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">su - dmdba
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> /home/dmdba/dmdbms/bin
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./dminit <span class="nv">path</span><span class="o">=</span>/home/dmdba/dmdata <span class="nv">PAGE_SIZE</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">16</span> <span class="nv">CHARSET</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">1</span> <span class="nv">INSTANCE_NAME</span><span class="o">=</span>DM <span class="nv">SYSDBA_PWD</span><span class="o">=</span>yourpassword <span class="nv">SYSAUDITOR_PWD</span><span class="o">=</span>yourpassword
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">su - root
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 设置系统服务</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">cd</span> /home/dmdba/dmdbms/script/root
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># -p 选项为设置服务名后缀</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./dm_service_installer.sh -t dmserver -dm_ini /home/dmdba/dmdata/DAMENG/dm.ini -p dm
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 启动</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">systemctl start DmServicedm
</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>最新的版本需要设置 SYSDBA_PWD 和 SYSAUDITOR_PWD 的密码，如何不设置将会提醒你设置。
生产模式中 PAGE_SIZE 可以设置 32，本文使用默认的大小写配置</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2025-10-27首发于<a href='https://jhlzlove.github.io/'>浮生一梦</a>，最后修改于2025-10-27</p>]]>
